:: Gabe Hang Out End Late Low Fun [nobr]

/* Intro */
As you walk along, you hear <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Gabe</span> yawn loudly. <span style="color:LightCoral">He is dragging his feet with his hands in his pockets, looking down at his watch. It is clear he hasn’t been enjoying his time with you</span> and you ask him about it. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“No worries,”</span> He chuckles, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I didn’t expect my dorky little bro to be that exciting anyway. But as fun as this has been, we should be heading home. Come on.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Gabe</span> grabs you by the hand, but you don’t follow and ask why you have to go home with him? You can stay out longer.<br>

