<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“No, you can’t. Dad knows I took you out, so if I come home without you and you’re out past curfew, I’ll get MY ass beat. So come on.”</span> <span style="color:LightCoral">You grumble a little bit but follow <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Gabe</span> to avoid getting yourself into trouble.</span> This day could have gone better.<br>
